      "trackName": "I Never Have Ever: Party Games",
      "description": "Discover the most exciting and fun party game!\nNever Ever is a classic game that will help you get to know your friends better and share unforgettable moments.\n\nGame Features:\n • Over a hundred unique cards, each of which will make you laugh or ponder.\n • Eight diverse packs, ranging from lighthearted to daring.\n • Unlimited fun and the opportunity to discover unexpected sides of your friends.\n • Create personalized questions—add your own ideas to the game and make it even more interesting.\n • Play on your watches.\n • Play with friends using iMessage.\n • Use the tasks that the game offers.\n\nThe rules of the game are simple:\nSelect a category, set a punishment, read the card and those who performed the action receive a punishment.\n\nYour subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. Your iTunes will automatically be charged at the same price for renewal, as stated above, within 24 hours prior to the end of the current subscription period. You can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/myappinfo1/privacy-policy\nTerms of use: https://sites.google.com/view/myappinfo/terms-of-use",
